{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>In a holy place.</b> In the court of the Tent of Meeting, and sheets would be spread for him." "<b>His garments.</b> Those in which he served every day. And some say they are the ones mentioned [above], and the proof is that it is not written \"and he donned other garments.\"" "<b>His burnt-offering.</b> It is the ram and the people's ram and the people's bull and seven of their lambs, for so it is written."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:26.846083370Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}